{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es el motor. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: un borde gastado delata cómo frenas. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena en mínimo. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.0, 0.323], ["qué", 0.363, 0.429], ["mira", 0.456, 0.616], ["un", 0.616, 0.682], ["mecánico", 0.695, 1.161], ["en", 1.161, 1.201], ["los", 1.201, 1.32], ["primeros", 1.387, 1.746], ["diez", 1.786, 1.932], ["segundos", 1.932, 2.384], ["que", 2.424, 2.491], ["llegas", 2.53, 2.783], ["al", 2.783, 2.876], ["taller?", 2.943, 3.328], ["No", 4.187, 4.35], ["es", 4.364, 4.486], ["el", 4.486, 4.554], ["motor.", 4.581, 5.057], ["Primero,", 6.006, 6.469], ["la", 6.794, 6.894], ["cadena:", 6.956, 7.394], ["si", 7.669, 7.819], ["cuelga", 7.881, 8.106], ["mucho,", 8.144, 8.481], ["ya", 8.769, 8.856], ["te", 8.931, 8.981], ["está", 8.981, 9.194], ["robando", 9.231, 9.569], ["fuerza.", 9.581, 9.981], ["Segundo,", 10.796, 11.427], ["las", 11.705, 11.869], ["llantas:", 11.907, 12.462], ["un", 12.715, 12.79], ["borde", 12.854, 13.068], ["gastado", 13.094, 13.447], ["delata", 13.485, 13.763], ["cómo", 13.826, 14.003], ["frenas.", 14.028, 14.52], ["Tercero,", 15.36, 15.898], ["el", 16.198, 16.323], ["humo", 16.335, 16.498], ["del", 16.535, 16.585], ["escape:", 16.598, 17.11], ["si", 17.373, 17.523], ["sale", 17.548, 17.773], ["azul,", 17.773, 18.185], ["está", 18.31, 18.61], ["quemando", 18.673, 18.935], ["aceite.", 18.935, 19.398], ["Y", 20.056, 20.15], ["lo", 20.191, 20.271], ["último…", 20.298, 20.795], ["cómo", 21.625, 21.867], ["suena", 21.894, 22.136], ["en", 22.136, 22.203], ["mínimo.", 22.216, 22.66], ["¿Tu", 23.361, 23.479], ["moto", 23.505, 23.729], ["pasaría", 23.795, 24.163], ["la", 24.19, 24.255], ["prueba?", 24.321, 24.663], ["Escríbenos", 25.728, 26.433], ["y", 26.44